The array index corresponds to the byte (e.g. index 0 is for bits 7:0).</description>
       <lsb>26</lsb>
       <msb>26</msb>
       <access>read-write</access>
       <enumeratedValues>
        <name>emac_gmacgrp_MAC_Address38_High_mbc_enum</name>
