         </enumeratedValue>
       </enumeratedValues>
      </field>
      <field>
       <name>send_initialization</name>
       <description>After power on, 80 clocks must be sent to the card for initialization before sending any commands to card. Bit should be set while sending first command to card so that controller will initialize clocks before sending command to card. This bit should not be set for either of the boot modes (alternate or mandatory).</description>
       <lsb>15</lsb>
       <msb>15</msb>
       <access>read-write</access>
