     <fields>
      <field>
       <name>volt_reg</name>
       <description>Determines the voltage fed to the buffers by an external voltage regulator. These bits function as the output of the host controller and are fed to an external voltage regulator. The voltage regulator must switch the voltage of the buffers of a particular card to either 3.3V or 1.8V, depending on the value programmed in the register.</description>
