      <field>
       <name>data</name>
       <description>This is the command write data upper byte. This should be setup before triggering the command with execute field (bit 0) of the Flash Command Control register. It is the data that is to be written to the flash for any status or configuration write operation carried out by triggering the event in the Flash Command Control register.</description>
       <lsb>0</lsb>
       <msb>31</msb>
       <access>read-write</access>
