    <register>
     <name>devgrp_doepmsk</name>
     <description>This register works with each of the Device OUT Endpoint Interrupt (DOEPINTn) registers for all endpoints to generate an interrupt per OUT endpoint. The OUT endpoint interrupt for a specific status in the DOEPINTn register can be masked by writing into the corresponding bit in this register. Status bits are masked by default</description>
