     <name>devgrp_daintmsk</name>
     <description>The Device Endpoint Interrupt Mask register works with the Device Endpoint Interrupt register to interrupt the application when an event occurs on a device endpoint. However, the Device All Endpoints Interrupt (DAINT) register bit corresponding to that interrupt is still set.</description>
