     <description>Transmission request bits for Message Objects 1 to 32.  By reading the TxRqst bits, the CPU can check for which Message Object a Transmission Request is pending. The TxRqst bit of a specific Message Object can be set/reset by the CPU via the IFx Message Interface Registers or set by the Message Handler after reception of a Remote Frame or reset by the Message Handler after a successful transmission. </description>
