   <description>Registers in the L4 Watchdog module</description>
   <disableCondition>(Peripherals-&gt;rstmgr-&gt;rstmgr_permodrst-&gt;l4wd0 == 1)</disableCondition><baseAddress>0xffd02000</baseAddress>
