    <register>
     <name>frzctrl_src</name>
     <description>Contains register field to choose between software state machine (vioctrl array index [1] register) or hardware state machine in the Freeze Controller as the freeze signal source for VIO channel 1.
All fields are only reset by a cold reset (ignore warm reset).</description>
